<speak>Take your time. With Pioneer Balanced Opportunities Fund, falling equity markets can pull down the equity holdings, while rising interest rates can reduce the value of the fixed-income holdings. During market stress, those holdings can fall together, so diversification may provide less protection than expected. You could lose some or all of the capital you invest in this fund. The transaction fee is 0.5% of the transaction amount. Are you willing to accept investment losses on this investment?</speak>